|GKB================================= Tattoo =================================
|GKB=|XX0   Syntax: ctattoo                                                      |GKB=
|GKB=|XX0                                                                        |GKB=
|GKB=|XX0   Any decent two-bit alchemist can turn lead into gold, but the true   |GKB=
|GKB=|XX0   measure of talent is proper control over your body and your tools.   |GKB=
|GKB=|XX0   With this, you can temporarily coat your hands with a bit of         |GKB=
|GKB=|XX0   quicksilver, and, as everyone knows, quicksilver can turn quite      |GKB=
|GKB=|XX0   violent when presented with enough pressure. If you hit hard         |GKB=
|GKB=|XX0   enough, you can cause the quicksilver to react and lash out.         |GKB=
|GKB==========================================================================
